Photorealistic luxury user-interface asset: one single round transport push button from a high-end studio tape machine, viewed perfectly straight-on, centered, filling about 70 percent of the image, isolated on a pure flat black background. Outer ring: polished champagne gold with a fine diamond-knurled edge and a mirror-polished inner bevel. Face: slightly domed glossy piano-black lacquer with one soft curved reflection across the upper third. A thin ring of warm amber light glows recessed between the gold ring and the black face, like a valve amplifier. Completely blank face: absolutely no symbol, no icon, no arrow, no text, no letters, no logo. Jewelry-grade product photography, crisp focus, perfectly circular and symmetrical, even studio lighting. One object only, no shadow on the background, no watermark.
